 "body_html": "<p>how to catch/check/test for an invalid pointer?</p>\n\n<p>m_gTest declared in .h file<br>\nnot initialized   </p>\n\n<pre><code>try\n{\n    delete m_gTest;\n}\ncatch(...)\n{\n    std::cout &lt;&lt; \"catch\" &lt;&lt; '\\n';\n}\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>instead of catching it</p>\n\n<pre><code>free(): invalid pointer: 0x00000000006053b8 ***\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>how to catch/check/test for an invalid pointer?</p>\n\n<pre><code>temp[i] = m_gTest[i];\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>does not cause error, but if m_gTest is invalid, then anything put in temp will be wrong</p>\n\n<p>o, and have used</p>\n\n<pre><code>if(m_gTest != NULL)\n</code></pre>\n",
